  "description": "Wolverine.Http support for AdCodicem value objects: each value-object parameter of an endpoint bound from its route value, query value, header or form field through its rules, and a refused or missing one answered 400 with RFC 9457 problem details carrying the violated rule's code, as minimal APIs answer it, every refusal of a request at once. AOT-compatible in Wolverine's static mode.",
